  intro D k _ _ _ _ p S T n n' _ _ _ _ α β LS LT hS hT Ψ hΨ
  exact GlobalTheory.FinPl.CombProof.isSBHalf_extFun D k p n n' S T α β LS LT hS hT Ψ hΨ

